      "description": "A shirtless, muscular man with a defined physique, wearing black boxing gloves and black trunks with a white stripe, is in the act of throwing a right-hand punch. His facial expression is focused and aggressive, and he is positioned on the right side of the frame. He appears to be the aggressor in the boxing match.",
