      "label": "hateful emotion expression",
      "description": "The emotion expressed is hateful, conveyed through the violent imagery of one boxer dominating the other, combined with the racist text that references historical slavery and dehumanizing stereotypes. The overall intent is to demean and insult a specific racial group by invoking violent hierarchy and food-based racial tropes.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
